rooms_desc ({"You are in the reception-room.  The room is utterly empty except fora ball of light that is floating in the middle of the room.All the walls and ceiling is covered with mirrors that reflect the lightcoming from the magical ball.","You have enter the waiting room.  The walls are all hanged with original paintings by very famous artists.You can see the door to the east leads into the living area, but thenorth door is locked.  There is a sign on the north door.","You have entered Donny's private bar.  There is a long bar-counterwith a sign on it.  Behind the counter are a number of shelves,some filled with beermugs and glasses while the rest of the shelvesare filled with bottles of liqueur, wine and beer.","You have just entered Donny's study.  Here he conducts all his buniness.In the center of the room you see an oak desk litter with papers.  Behind thedesk is a very comfortable chair.  The walls are lined with shelves stackedwith new and old books alike.","This is a beautifull dinning-room.  There are a long table lined with24 chairs.  The table has already been laid with the houses finestsilver.","An elegant little garden.  There is a lot of plants and trees tobe seen here.  Through the undergrowth you can see the fleeingimages of pure white stags.  In the trees you notice a large numberfalcons who seen to be watching you.","The room is mainly used for personal storage.","This is Donny's trophy-room.  You can see a lot of replicas of monstersfound in the Holy Mission.  You get a funny feeling a about thesereplicas, they look just to real.  The walls are hanged with a varietyof shields.","You have just entered a void held here buy powerfull magic.  In thevoid you don't seem to hear anything and all you see is a faint lightcoming from the south.",0,})
rooms_short ({"The reception-room.","Waiting-room","The bar","The study.","The dinning-room","The garden.","The private room.","The trophy-room","The void.",0,})
