items ({({"ball of light","You are scared by seeing visions of your future.","mirrors","Yack!  What a face.",}),({"paintings","All the paintings are of natural disasters.","sign","    >>>>>>PRIVATE<<<<<<",}),({"counter","A long pine counter with a sign on it, maybe you should look at it.","sign","The bar is closed for the day.","bottles","The bottles is asking to be used.","beermugs","All have been washed and is ready to be used.","glasses","There are rows of clean glasses that what to be used.",}),({"desk","An old oak desk.  It look very old and worn yet in good condition.","shelves","The shelves is full of books on magic and a few rare ones on dragons.","books","The books are not on a subject of your liking.","chair","It is a lazyboy where Donny spends a lot of time working.",}),({"table","It is a very long oak table used very often for Donny's partys.","chairs","All the chairs look alike and seem to have been made by magic.","silver","The table is laid with silver knifes, forks, plates and goblets.",}),({"plants","All sorts of ferns and other small plants.","trees","A mix of oak and pine trees.","stags","Tame stags caught by Donny when he was bored.","falcons","The falcons are use as spy's.  So look out....",}),0,({"replicas","There are Trolls, Dragons, Spirits, Witches and Players.","shields","All the shields were either won or stolen by Donny.",}),0,0,})
